WEBVTT

00:26:58.446 --> 00:27:00.779
A social justice warrior --
what are they doing

00:27:00.803 --> 00:27:06.366
other than to look out for the interests
of invisible communities and voices

00:27:06.390 --> 00:27:10.550
and people who, for years,
have not been properly acknowledged?

00:27:10.574 --> 00:27:12.983
You know, there is power
to be readdressed.

00:27:13.007 --> 00:27:16.863
You described that battle as a zero-sum,
sort of ... just a power shift

00:27:16.887 --> 00:27:19.822
between two different tribes.

00:27:19.846 --> 00:27:22.232
Why is it different
from what you're talking about?

00:27:22.256 --> 00:27:24.140
DB: Well, first of all, I'm a moderate,

00:27:24.164 --> 00:27:26.993
so I think politics is a competition
between partial truths.

00:27:27.017 --> 00:27:29.856
I think all real political movements
have an essential truth

00:27:29.880 --> 00:27:32.602
that they're grasping,
and we're trying to find a balance.